Testing was carried out to confirm that the system works correctly and reliably. Unit testing checked individual functions, integration testing verified that modules worked together, and system testing evaluated the complete application. Specific test cases confirmed that a valid login opens the dashboard, an invalid password produces an error message, a registered student is recognized and marked present, an unregistered person is shown as unknown without any record being created, duplicate attendance is blocked, and reports export successfully. Performance testing examined behavior with many simultaneous users, security testing checked for problems such as SQL injection and weak password storage, and user acceptance testing gathered feedback from five to ten real users. All bugs found were logged, fixed, and retested.
